WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.558 --> 00:00:10.592
Consumption History lists everything used on the job, taken from the daily logs.

2
00:00:10.592 --> 00:00:17.186
Material consumption shows each material used, on which day, and against which task.

3
00:00:17.186 --> 00:00:26.959
Use the search filters to narrow the list, and sort it by date or by quantity. Labour consumption works the same way for the people on site.

4
00:00:26.959 --> 00:00:32.391
Export to CSV or PDF when you need it outside Sitetru.
